Z||000003||mrfiero||05-26-2001||11:33 AM||||Cheever,<P>I only saw the one Fiero.....an '88 Formula with an early coupe nose (not sure why).  I believe it was on 31st street, but I will get the exact address when  go back to snap a picture.<P>Songman,<P>I was a long trip!  About 15oo miles from Denver to Montgomery, AL then another 900 or so miles to Tulsa via a Greyhound bus.  I don't care what the commercials say.....DON'T go Greyhound!.......it was painfully slow and crowded.<P>I'm about to take off for the last 700 miles to Denver in my "new" T-Top GT (thanks Tony!).<P>I wondered what happened......I thought I had written down the wrong phone number at first, then I double checked it on my computer.  Oh well.  I will be back in the neighborhood later this summer, so eventually we'll hook up.<P>Take it easy.    	   ||||reg||1
